Runtime:
--------

Runtime packages for ROCm components including libraries and tools necessary for
running ROCm, HIP, OpenCL, OpenMP and ML applications.


rocm                       All core ROCm packages, tools, and libraries.

rocm-language-runtime      ROCm runtime environment for running applications on
                           the AMD platform.

rocm-hip-runtime           Run HIP applications written for the AMD platform.

rocm-hip-libraries         HIP libraries optimized for the AMD platform.

rocm-opencl-runtime        Run OpenCL-based applications on the AMD platform.

rocm-ml-libraries          Key machine learning libraries. Includes MIOpen.


Developer:
----------

Developer packages for building, debugging and profiling applications or libraries
for HIP, OpenCL, OpenMP and ML.


rocm-developer-tools       Debug and profile HIP applications.

rocm-hip-runtime-dev       Develop applications on HIP or port from CUDA.

rocm-hip-sdk               Develop or port HIP applications and libraries for the 
                           AMD platform.

rocm-opencl-sdk            Develop OpenCL-based applications for the AMD platform.

rocm-openmp-sdk            Develop OpenMP-based applications for the AMD platform.

rocm-ml-sdk                Develop and run machine learning applications for AMD.


Other:
------

amdgpu-lib                 For users of graphics applications which require the 
                           open source Mesa 3D graphics and multimedia libraries.
                           This package is primarily used for Radeon GPUs.

